<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .cta-link { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 0 20px; color: #0066cc; word-break: break-all; }
        .comment-box { background-color: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 4px 0 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .divider { border: none; border-top: 2px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0; }
        .lang-label { font-size: 0.75em; color: #999; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p class="lang-label">Deutsch</p>
    <p>Hi!</p>
    <p>Wir haben deine Einreichung <strong>"{{ fields.get('title', '') }}"</strong> geprüft und bitten dich, einige Überarbeitungen vorzunehmen.</p>
    {% if fields.get('moderation-comment') %}
    <p><strong>Kommentar des Teams:</strong></p>
    <div class="comment-box">{{ fields.get('moderation-comment') }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <p>Du kannst deine Einreichung hier bearbeiten:</p>
    <a class="cta-link" href="{{ settings.FRONTEND_BASE_URL }}/entities/{{ node.id }}">{{ settings.FRONTEND_BASE_URL }}/entities/{{ node.id }}</a>
    <p>Bitte zögere nicht, dich bei uns zu melden, wenn du irgendwelche Fragen hast.</p>
    <hr class="divider">
    <p class="lang-label">English</p>
    <p>Hi!</p>
    <p>We have reviewed your submission <strong>"{{ fields.get('title', '') }}"</strong> and would like to ask you to make some revisions.</p>
    {% if fields.get('moderation-comment') %}
    <p><strong>Comment from the team:</strong></p>
    <div class="comment-box">{{ fields.get('moderation-comment') }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <p>You can edit your submission here:</p>
    <a class="cta-link" href="{{ settings.FRONTEND_BASE_URL }}/entities/{{ node.id }}">{{ settings.FRONTEND_BASE_URL }}/entities/{{ node.id }}</a>
    <p>Please don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions.</p>
</body>
</html>
